      "type": "text",
      "value": "Make use of the following modals in sentences as asked in brackets. 12"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "i. Could. (To express a past ability)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "ii. Must. (To express certainty)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "iii. Must+ have+ past participle of verb. (To express guess logically)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "rv. Should. (To express propriety)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "v. Should+ have+ past particle of verb. (To express a past action not discharged)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "vi. Would. (to express a past irregular habit)"
    }
